meta {
  name: Reject Membership
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/memberships/{{membershipId}}/reject
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Rejects a waiting membership – a business REST endpoint that drives the process forward
  (controller → use case → adapter → message correlation), no Tasklist form involved.
  Available from Exercise 6 on. Uses the `membershipId` captured by `Register Membership`;
  set it manually if you start here.
}
